{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-23T01:42:21.075Z","author":"codex","author_source":"configured","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"69d1128247c162375b1cf4c6","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-23T01:42:21.074Z","author":"codex","text":"Implemented. The closeout workflow's single jq projection of the run's plan JSON now also emits per-action counts (close, refuse, skip, needs_review); a bash function closeout_publication_text derives the PR title, the PR summary sentence and the commit message from those counts, so a plan without a close action publishes 'chore(pm): record merged-PR closeout review candidates' with a summary that states no items were closed and prints the per-action counts, while any close action keeps the exact previous closure wording. README closeout section and the workflow test helper document both titles. New test file test/closeout-publication-text.test.ts holds the two issue fixtures (review-only plan and closing plan, end to end through the real workflow bash) and a 254-case property corpus (explicit edge plans plus 250 seeded random mixes) that extracts the real jq filter and the real bash function from the workflow and asserts title, summary sentence, per-action counts and routine-skip counts always agree with an independent oracle over the same plan. Revert proof: with only .github/workflows/pm-github-closeout.yml reverted to origin/main (all other changes in place), both new fixture/property tests fail (review-only title not selected, counts missing), and the passing tests were re-run after restoring the fix. Touched/referencing test files pass at quick depth: closeout-publication-text (3), closeout-workflow-publication + closeout-workflow-decisions (51), bot-pr-workflow + self-versioned-workflows + ci-handoff-workflow + ci-routing (196); typecheck, lint, docstring and duplication gates pass."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-23T01:42:21.075Z"}],"before_hash":"461a355d35a65ed0c85660b2001cf6cf668c9bfaf3e8d5226e84b380cab5a53d","after_hash":"4e7ed9ee2e2d3434c4edcafc4f39f759c40413af100cf208860b32b17e9ddb49","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"93eb8f24fc86783aef01b622224984c9f53d94c7d300960542be14863d8d7614"}
